# Architecture Rules

- Backend: FastAPI in `backend/app/` — api, agents, tools, core, db, models are separate modules.
- Do not merge agent logic into API routes or collapse tools into one file.
- Every API/tool call requires `client_id`; RBAC enforced in backend, not by LLM.
- Read `memory-bank/core/architecture.md` and `agent-surface.md` before backend changes.
- Red Zone: `core/`, `agents/`, routing/eval tools, prompts, metric logic, `infra/deploy/`.
- Green Zone: frontend UI, docs, non-sensitive helpers.

If memory-bank core files are not referenced, refuse implementation and ask to load them first.
